      <span class="tg-hero__type">Topical Study</span>
      <h1 class="tg-hero__title">The Straight and Narrow Path</h1>
      <p class="tg-hero__intro">
        Walking with God is the oldest description of the believing life in Scripture —
        older than the law, older than Israel. This study follows the road: where the gate
        is, what pushes a person off the path, and what it takes to still be walking at
        the end.
      </p>
      <blockquote class="tg-hero__key-verse">
        <p>Enter by the narrow gate. For the gate is wide and the way is easy that leads
          to destruction, and those who enter by it are many. For the gate is narrow and
          the way is hard that leads to life, and those who find it are few.</p>
        <cite><a class="ref" data-ref="Matthew 7:13-14">Matthew 7:13–14</a></cite>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
  </header><main style="--tg-accent: #14524a">
